{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"22b008145e310263d3d8cc0e97ec5785e325ffb786455aa9ca556957d72031a2","ja":"ハイブランドとのコラボをした真たちは、\nその縁で、業界のパーティーに招待されていて……","zh":"与高端品牌合作的真她们，因为这次合作的缘分，被邀请参加了业内的派对……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7b4ed66fe8598adb8ceb1f0d897f4ff86866a0a711be33e187cb962cdfe45f45","ja":"見てください、なのです。とびきり・わんだほー！な\nお料理が並んでいるのですよ♪","zh":"请看，这里摆着特别棒的\n料理哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f18b582c63156e3b352f48b92704c92dab0dafea716ee01008e0a2ce7c33c0e9","ja":"うふふ。楽しいパーティーになりそうですね～。","zh":"呵呵，看来会变成一场愉快的派对呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"efa8c3b41e18665357ccc4786d1bf9112d6f6f087c6f5527103d8e34bb998866","ja":"こ、こんなに豪華で、\n偉い人がたくさん集まっているパーティーなのに……。","zh":"这、这么豪华的派对，明明还有这么多大人物聚在一起……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ac0517ab6b8b790bd182bc1041ca57d6caaf13ec15afcdfe08e19e11be0f4e7a","ja":"ど、どうしてふたりとも、\nそんなに落ち着いていられるの～！？","zh":"为、为什么你们两个都能这么冷静啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1c8b85e17a9e0f4fd10d9c8822100f4fe419be71431fc011f6363644bc1c98fa","ja":"まつりちゃんと朋花ちゃんは、さすがね……。\n私は緊張しちゃって。そんなに堂々とできないわ。","zh":"玛茜和朋花真不愧是她们……  \n我都紧张起来了，没法像她们那样落落大方。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2d22f9b681e999b2a94fb3d046fdfaa98516d105d3dd7eb23456ec8f5f4f929c","ja":"は、はい……みなさん、とっても綺麗で……華やかで。\nわ、私……場違いなんじゃ……！","zh":"是、是的……大家都非常漂亮……光彩夺目。\n我、我是不是不该出现在这里……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c815f4eb8f698eff5f285d8996d6026729ca05148e30e035867e7ebb396b6ba5","ja":"いやいや、可憐もバッチリ馴染んでるって！\nアタシなんてもう、心臓バクバクで……。","zh":"不不，可怜也已经完全融入了嘛！\n我都已经紧张得心脏怦怦直跳了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ce55e65c37755c3b25c7c6496ee30c7ff26c3ffe0f7a818ca4a69fcf510fde57","ja":"……あっ、ミラス・ミランの社員さんだ！\r\nコラボしたアタシ達を呼んでるみたい。行ってくるよ。","zh":"……啊，是米拉斯·米兰的员工！好像在叫我们这些参与合作的人。我要过去看看。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"6074327f76a35e033904cd5504a763b6b6fd945ba3905a8604df91a9638204af","ja":"私も、スカジの方に呼ばれてるみたい。\nそれじゃあ、また後でね。","zh":"我好像也被斯卡吉那边叫去了。\n那待会儿见。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"403397716b2947bb9c138aef73aa793f8778a5d6e7027209a8c0a947714e616c","ja":"「どうぞこちらへ。\n社長！　先日、コラボしていただいた皆さんです！」","zh":"“请往这边走。\n社长！这位就是前些天和我们合作的各位！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"7e9603c3b3b2166361ebc879e7b7f12f5ec8406155549aabfa87d2415e784584","ja":"社長さん……！　は、はい、どうも。\nご、ご無沙汰……じゃなかった、はじめまして！","zh":"社长……！啊、嗯，你好。\n好、好久不见……不对，初次见面！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"90ed41d549f1aeadb1331f836e26755063029e3cd407b685a0c30a618888dff3","ja":"「先日は大変お世話になりました。ささやかでは\nありますが、どうぞ自由にお楽しみください」","zh":"前些日子承蒙您的关照。虽然不是什么贵重的东西，还请随意享用。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"83a6af57a2da049d9658b592c2cafa661a9f1ed865ee11b35d71d3b9e8c229fc","ja":"ありがとうございます、なのです。","zh":"谢谢您。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"b92191e019c3b468d7f85c6ceb69613acd5507b37eee715ba7aa501fecae81b7","ja":"すてきなパーティーにご招待いただいて、\n姫はとってもはっぴー！なのですよ♪","zh":"能受邀参加这么棒的派对，  \n本公主超级开心哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1780.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"6d3167c36a803d3cef0f3bd5bdf47cb0c55e3274838a6b3164753d312b848e40","ja":"（社長さんの前でも……いつも通りで……。\nまつりさんって、やっぱりすごいな……）","zh":"（在社长面前也……还是一如既往……。\n茉莉小姐果然很厉害啊……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
